  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Treatment regimens for pulmonary TB by age group (infants under 3 months, children 3 months to under 12 years, adolescents 12–<16 and 16–<20 years) and disease severity, giving the intensive-phase and continuation-phase regimens.",
